# Allowlist: only the files the Dockerfile copies reach the build context, so local data,
# downloaded models, virtual environments, caches and secrets (.env) never do.
# A new COPY in the Dockerfile needs a matching "!" entry here.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!scripts/download_models.py
!data/corpus/
!.streamlit/

**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
